Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(session): keep permission prompts in subagent views

Viewing a subagent dropped its permission requests, so the dialog never
opened and auto-accept approved nothing. Keep the viewed session and its
descendants, and do not let the child composer cover the prompt.
---
